  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Strength Deck 30: Keldeo, a 30-card half deck released on 20 April 2012 for the film Kyurem VS. the Sword of Justice, easy to play and meant for players new to battling. It is led by the Mythical Pokémon Keldeo as a holo card with strong attacks and high HP, and its other two Battle Strength holo cards are the Trainers Rocky Helmet and Eviolite. A strengthening guide and a quick guide came with it.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: ポケモンカードゲームBW バトル強化デッキ30「ケルディオ」",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20120326193523/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/bw/kld/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia (Japanese): ポケモンカードゲームの発売タイトル一覧",
